  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "The one thing that annoys me for the Android version of vrchat is that you cant show very poor avatars. Now i understand thats for performance but it to me doesnt make sense when there is phones and other android devices that are powerful enough to handle those avis. It would be nice to have a simple toggle that you can enable that would allow very poor avis to be seen on Android. With a warning that says very poor avatars can cause lag and use up more battery life. It just feels weird that a more powerful android device (like the latest Samsung and pixel phones) that can very likely handle very poor avis cant even show them.",
